    "Manual sales write off stock by batches (V71), banquet reservations released after issue/closure",
    "Unified forms OP-3/7/10/11/12/18/21/23 (V72), getting-started guide (DOK_11)",
    "KBJU with source and status, reference book IP RAMN 2002, normative audit fixes (V73)",
    "Product recall / withdrawal procedure: scope, forward trace, recall blocks, decisions, notifications, PDF, drill (V74)",
    "Recall aligned with GOST R ISO 22000-2019 (8.3, 8.9.4, 8.9.5, 9.3) and 29-FZ (art. 3, 24, 25): responsible persons, procedure PDF, responses, release grounds, disposal, disinfection, management review (V74.1)",
    "Hazard analysis and HACCP/OPRP plan per GOST R ISO 22000-2019 cl. 8.5: team, method, descriptions, flow diagrams with on-site confirmation, hazard assessment, control measures, validation, review, plan PDF (V75)",
    "Emergency preparedness (GOST R ISO 22000-2019 cl. 8.4): scenarios approved by management, incidents with notifications, affected batches, analysis, procedure tests, PDFs; monitoring and measuring (cl. 8.7): instrument info, mercury ban (SanPiN cl. 48), calibration history, fault -> evaluation of previous measurements -> block until passing check, status labels, software validation (V76)",
    "Brakerage by sales (V77): dishes sold to order today / usually sold, one-tap \"conforms\" writes J02 after explicit confirmation, remarks open the brakerage form; home button for the chef",
    "Drive folder layout (V78): installation (migration step 15) creates 27 sections under the shared folder, legacy folders registered as is, modules and hardcoded folder IDs resolved from the registry, documents and PDFs stored by category, folder/file browser with search, own folder per section, gather legacy folders",
    "Shift sales (V79): end-of-shift sales document (CSV/Excel/Sheet/PDF) or list, mapping to TTK/stock with remembered names, subtract already-entered manual sales, stock dry-run, one confirmation posts each line as a regular sale (J36 + V71 write-off)",
    "One tap (V80): batch brakerage in the shared brakerage list, incoming control reusing previous acceptance (no-temperature reason or limits), J05 rotation only for expiring batches (threshold 0-7 days), daily sample with previous container/location and home button",
    "Journals from entered data (V81): training -> J16/J17, instrument fault and emergency with equipment -> J18 with results, expired stock -> write-off act button, fryer J38 start/end buttons, staff health self-mark and J07 approval list",
    "Eggs (V82): GOST 31654-2012 / 31655-2012 acceptance marks (kind, class, category, sorting date, shell, marking) with quarantine on failure, egg processing only by approved regime with egg scope and 12-day washed-egg limit, dishes with raw eggs and Salmonella hazard prefill, children catering warnings (SanPiN 2.3/2.4.4282-26 app. 6), egg shelf-life reference with sources; fix: eggs no longer get poultry-meat limits",
    "Egg processing by consumption (V83): egg batches consumed by production and made-to-order sales (TRACE_LINKS) without a processing record -> card in Brakerage, Eggs and home; one-tap confirmed record with approved regime and quantity from consumption; pre-processed batch quantity counts; older than 3 days shown as count",
    "Instrument check by reference (V84): tolerance from instrument passport, reference check points (reference vs instrument), deviation vs tolerance, J19/J20 rows written from the check, out of tolerance blocks the instrument and opens evaluation, monthly J19/J20 question replaced by due list; fix: captured originals renamed so the access gate does not wrap them",
    "Pest-control act from photo (V85): OCR (Yandex Vision) or pasted text -> contractor, act number and date, kind, premises, products, product documents, contract; editable draft with warnings (enterprise address absent, no contract, no product documents); confirmed post -> J14 (mirrored J28), file in Documents/Contracts, duplicate guard; fix: V84 journal author",
    "Audit R2 fixes (V86): fryer cycle written first, then steps (stock, J38) with step marks; idempotent retry by key (or same user/data within 2 min) and resume of an unfinished step; optional oil batch from stock (useBatch, FEFO, trace link); mandatory end reason from a list; oil balance check with NEEDS_REVIEW and reviewer sign-off; one J07 row per employee (self-mark -> inspection; scheduled J07 questions off by default, existing row patched and its question closed; answer via journal question synced); training idempotency; J18 patch by exact source ID; banquet journal catch-up up to 3 days with late notice",
    "My shift (V87): one task list for every employee from all sources (journal questions the user keeps, HACCP controls and kitchen tasks, health self-mark and inspection, fryer, brakerage, eggs, instrument checks, daily samples, expired stock, shift sales, own operation results) grouped as overdue / needs action / now / later / waiting for others / done; inline answers and simple actions; unified operation outcome {status, message, completed, pending, blocked, hint, next} for key shift operations with a result card and honest no-response message; fixes: incoming control closes J03 questions (numeric column), scheduled journal questions no longer duplicated (time cell vs HH:mm)",
    "Shift stock (V88): semi-finished prep by norm from sales history (J36, 4 weeks by week, TTK explosion incl. nested semis; norm = per-day demand x cover days or manual norm; to make = norm - usable stock - planned; one-tap planProduction); expiring batches (N days) with dishes and portions, go-list snapshot with human special offer and print; batch actions: spoil (wasteBatch), staff meal (write-off act STAFF), resort (product used instead of a TTK product in sales write-off until the allocated quantity is used; daily report: portions, revenue, TTK cost vs actual, food cost, margin loss)",
    "Shift email (V89): morning / midday / pre-closing emails by location shift schedule and time zone; fallback schedule, short and overnight shifts, catch-up LATE_NOTIFICATION; idempotency key, REPORT_CHANGED_AFTER_SEND, limited mail retries; content by recipient rights (finance, payroll, procurement, expiry); supplier requests per supplier; expiry categories; stock suggestions with statuses; PDF/Excel/TXT attachments on Drive with SHA-256; CONFIGURATION_REQUIRED",
    "Norm & lab reconciliation (V90): 23 documents from the enterprise norm registry of 20.11.2026 added with status and applicability (no overwrite, change log); registry tab; GOST sources marked voluntary; daily sample profile per SanPiN 2.3/2.4.4282-26 (cl. 56 subcl. 4 and 12, cl. 59 subcl. 10, cl. 65 subcl. 3) controls release gate, retention (medical: 48 h after end of sale) and readiness R08; legacy lab writes refused (USE_V67), ?labs=1 routed to V67 screen; TU lab confirmation requires PASS + file + SHA-256 + sample of the same TU version with status TESTED",
    "Semi-finished passport & shelf-life validation (V91): draft passport per produced batch (traceability, TTK/TU, CCP, brakerage, lab, technologist project, specialist doc-form decision, gaps, PDF SHA-256, versions; never changes batch expiry); validation programme (criteria with source, mandatory micro indicator, points 0..claimed end, plan approved by another person, V67 samples linked with actual storage hours, storage temperatures with source); lab accreditation registry (manual check, scope, validity); review -> authorization by another person -> V38 rule with report -> activation from today for new batches of the same TTK version; V38 approved shelf-life rules require a basis (normative registry document, manufacturer, approved validation)",
    "Role-based My Shift (V92): roles Storekeeper, Purchaser, Accountant/Economist, Cashier, Shift lead, Site administrator; perms revenue_view, procurement_cost_view, cash_view, task_assign; role blocks with money hidden without rights; priority colour + text, responsible role, ROLE_OWNER_NOT_CONFIGURED with cover mapping, task transfer with comment/evidence/history/audit; no automatic moves, write-offs, orders or bonuses",
    "Forecast, risks and promotion drafts (V93): sales forecast from the sales journal by weekday (statistics, not a neural network) with range, confidence and INSUFFICIENT_DATA; deficit before shift end and write-off probability by replaying past weeks (FEFO); risk register AI_Риски with RiskScore = P x Impact x Exposure, factors visible, closed only by a person; AI promotion drafts AI_ПроектыАкций (DRAFT only), bans (expired/quarantine/blocked batch, no confirmed V64 cost, reserved, no TTK/period/location/owner), margin/discount exceptions approved by a non-author, negative margin only by director; manual approve/publish/stop with audit, no price or finance changes, monitoring and stop suggestions, approved emergency stop; My Shift cards and block, shift e-mail section; V92 fix: only data-owner tasks are transferable",
    "Cash Z-reports, lamp passports, sensor stub and sensor documents (V94)",
    "Erroneous sale cancellation with storno and stock return (V95)",
    "Product catalog: manufacturer, barcode, status, review groups (V96)",
    "Sites, warehouses, sales channels, transfers (V97)",
    "Staff shift schedule and shortage (V98)",
    "Working spreadsheet ID in installation settings (V99)",
    "Personal data technical measures (V100)",
    "Restaurant Service: halls, tables, bookings, preorders, forecast; waiter order book — orders, courses, weighed items, production queue, internal bills and split; guest menu Reels with in-app media, publication, guest requests by table QR; role editor; kitchen and bar display, Stop/Go, serve, replace, cancel with consumption; bar roles, bar recipes and preps via MON CHEF production, stock write-off by TTK at «ready»; sale posting to J36 at order close with V64 cost, refunds by storno, shift report with Z reconciliation, preorder ingredient forecast; all staff screens inside the main window (V101, stages 2–8.1)"
